{% from "icons.njk" import icon %}
{% from "macros.njk" import book %}
{% include "hero.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <h2>Built for adventure. Comfortable when you get back.</h2>
      <p>Supernova is purpose built for people who want the wild places of the Pacific Northwest without giving up a hot shower and a good bed.</p>
      <p>Whether you're diving remote corners of the San Juans or watching the sunset from the flybridge, she's your floating home for the trip.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="video" data-src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/SsU-7J9OtSg?autoplay=1&rel=0" data-title="Video walk through of Supernova">
      {% img "main-salon.webp", "Supernova's main salon with built in seating and wide windows", "(max-width:760px) 100vw, 560px", "lazy", "" %}
      <button class="play" aria-label="Play the Supernova video walk through"></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-sand">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Supernova at a glance</h2>
    <div class="features three">
      <div class="feature"><div class="icon">{{ icon('shower') }}</div><h3>Four private staterooms</h3><p>Each with an ensuite bathroom and shower. Sleeps six plus crew on crewed charters and 8 or more on dry boat charters. A day head on the main level too.</p></div>
      <div class="feature"><div class="icon">{{ icon('chef') }}</div><h3>A real galley</h3><p>Two full size fridge freezers, a dedicated drinks fridge, plenty of food storage for long trips, plus a barbecue and sink on the flybridge.</p></div>
      <div class="feature"><div class="icon">{{ icon('dive') }}</div><h3>Dive ready</h3><p>Onboard compressor for tank refills between dives.</p></div>
      <div class="feature"><div class="icon">{{ icon('boat') }}</div><h3>Water toys</h3><p>15 foot dinghy (70 HP, seats seven), four paddleboards, two kayaks and a 10 by 10 foot inflatable floating dock with swim ladder.</p></div>
      <div class="feature"><div class="icon">{{ icon('map') }}</div><h3>Long range cruising</h3><p>Full Garmin electronics, twin Detroit Diesels (1,500 HP) and a 1,500 gallon fuel tank.</p></div>
      <div class="feature"><div class="icon">{{ icon('wifi') }}</div><h3>Off grid, still connected</h3><p>60 GPH water maker, 2,500 watts of solar, lithium power bank, two quiet 20 kW generators, Starlink, Wi-Fi and streaming TVs.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap split rev">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Support vessel</span>
      <h2>The landing craft</h2>
      <p>When the trip calls for it, we tow our rugged 21 foot aluminum landing craft. Twin 140 HP outboards, seating for up to 10, and a front loading bow gate for beach landings and easy water entry for divers.</p>
      <p>She's outfitted with radar, downriggers and pot pullers for shore excursions, live boat dive support, bike transport and hauling in your catch.</p>
    </div>
    {% img "landing-craft-inlet.webp", "The 21 foot aluminum landing craft beached in a mountain inlet", "(max-width:760px) 100vw, 560px", "lazy", "" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-sand" id="staterooms" style="scroll-margin-top:100px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>The staterooms</h2>
    <p>Four staterooms, each with its own bathroom and shower. A true home on the water after a day out.</p>
    <div class="rooms">
      <div class="room">
        {% img "master-suite.webp", "Master Suite with king bed and wood paneling", "(max-width:760px) 100vw, 560px", "lazy", "" %}
        <h3>Master Suite</h3>
        <p>Our most spacious room: a king bed, dual vanity sinks, full private bathroom with an expansive shower, plenty of storage and a streaming TV.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="room">
        {% img "mermaid-room.webp", "The Mermaid Room's queen bed beneath a glass mermaid headboard", "(max-width:760px) 100vw, 560px", "lazy", "" %}
        <h3>The Mermaid Room</h3>
        <p>Tucked into the bow, with a queen bed beneath our signature glass mermaid headboard, a private bathroom with full shower and a streaming TV.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="room">
        {% img "salmon-room.webp", "The Salmon Room with queen bed and soft lighting", "(max-width:760px) 100vw, 560px", "lazy", "" %}
        <h3>The Salmon Room</h3>
        <p>Cozy and calm, with a queen bed, private bathroom with shower, streaming TV, soft lighting and natural tones.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="room">
        {% img "orca-room-bunks.webp", "The Orca Room's upper and lower bunk beds", "(max-width:760px) 100vw, 560px", "lazy", "" %}
        <h3>The Orca Room (bunks)</h3>
        <p>Twin bunks with its own bathroom and shower. Great for kids and teens, and usually used by crew when not booked.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {{ book(site) }}
    <p style="margin-top:28px"><strong>Extra space on dry boat charters:</strong> high quality inflatable beds can be set up in the enclosed flybridge or on the open upper deck for a night under the stars.</p>
  </div>
</section>

